  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Under the Bodhi tree you sat,

    and the universe gathered around you.

    There
    you stayed at the center of all

    yet you were looking far beyond.


    You
    listened to every voice,

    not with the ear but with the soul.

    And when
    you released the Self you held,

    you found awakening in the Whole

    timeless,
    perfect as it is.


    Oh Buddha, oh Buddha,

    When the sun rose in the East,

    you
    opened your eyes to the light.

    Your feet were firm upon the earth,

    your
    presence steady, upright.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7f71b55df1cfc6b43b403a85a1d7b7d5, type: 2}
