  m_text: 'The burning of herbs and incense is an ancient practice that can be performed
    for different purposes in Buddhism, whether it be to offer to the Three Jewels
    (Buddha, Dharma, Sangha), to create an environment conducive to meditation, or
    to purify the body and mind.

    Each herb has something to offer, leading the
    way to a balanced mind and a peaceful spirit.'
